<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wesley Jessen raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wesley Jessen raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex. Brown said it upgraded Wesley Jessen VisionCare Inc to strong buy from buy.  </p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Wesley Jessen, a contact lens manufacturer, rose 1-5/8 to 19-5/8.</p>
